 "arithmetic": "integers and Q(sqrt5); every listed identity is exact",
 "statement": {
  "group": "rotation group of a cubic frame: order 12, simply transitive on the twelve ports (all five frames)",
  "generators": "F = exchange of the two ports of each frame seam (right translation by the half-turn about the long axis of the base port); C+ and C- = thirds of a turn of every port inside its face of the first and of the second inscribed tetrahedron (right translations by the thirds of a turn about n+s+l and -n+s+l)",
  "adjacency": "A = F + C+ + C+^-1 + C- + C-^-1; kernel = 1 - (5 - A)/60",
  "port_space": "1 + 1' + 1'' + 3 x 3: three Klein-invariant functions (on the three golden rectangles) and nine matrix coefficients rho(g_p)_ij",
  "second_action": "right translations = the centralizer of the frame rotations in the permutations of the ports (12 elements, canonical as a set). Canonical with names: F, P (antipode), F P, C+, C-. The labelling of the right translations by group elements depends on the base port through conjugation: R_(a p0)(k) = R_p0(a^-1 k a).",
  "kernel_on_second_index": "singlets: 5, -1, -1 (A = 2J - 1 on the rectangles). Triplet: M3 = [[-1,0,0],[0,-1,2],[0,2,1]] in the body axes (normal, short, long) of the base port, for every frame and base port. In fixed frame coordinates M3 takes six values (base ports p and P p agree).",
  "commuting_part": "of the twelve right translations only the identity and P commute with the kernel",
  "M3_eigenvectors": "(0,1,phi): sqrt5, the port itself (slow band); (1,0,0): -1, the normal of the rectangle (triplet inside the quintet); (0,phi,-1): -sqrt5, the conjugate port (fast band)",
  "mixing_angle": "tan = 1/phi between the slow eigenvector and the long axis; squared components (1/2+1/10*r5) and (1/2+-1/10*r5)",
